     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\">Susan, </div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">I&#39;m not 100% sure on this, but does this labeler do what you want?</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\">library(tidyverse)</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\">df1 &lt;- read_csv(&quot;~/Downloads/df1.csv&quot;)</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\">faclabs &lt;- levels(as.factor(df1$well))</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"></div></div></div>"
