    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div>Brandon, thank you for your response. I apologize for not concisely defining the problem in yesterday&#39;s post - it&#39;s the <u>annotations</u> within the facets (not the facet labels) where I&#39;d like the subscript formatting. Which isn&#39;t a problem if I don&#39;t subset the data. But, using yesterday&#39;s example, how do I achieve this (subscript of &quot;SI&quot;) in this final line of code?</div><div>Have tried to use various permutations of &quot;expression&quot; to no avail.</div><div><br></div><div>p1 + geom_text(data=df1[df1$interval==&quot;scr&quot; &amp; df1$id2==1,], aes(x=Inf, y=-Inf, label = paste(&quot;CVSI =&quot;, cv2)), size=3, vjust=2, hjust=1.1)</div><div>hope this makes more sense!</div><div>Best, Susan</div></div>"
    ],
