profiles in well subset; left vertical line denotes screened interval (SI)&quot;, subtitle=expression(paste(&quot;Desired facet label format: &quot;, CV[SI],&quot; = …&quot;)))</span></pre></blockquote></div><br>Susan, </div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">I&#39;m not 100% sure on this, but does this labeler do what you want?</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\">library(tidyverse)</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\">df1 &lt;- read_csv(&quot;~/Downloads/df1.csv&quot;)</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\">faclabs &lt;- levels(as.factor(df1$well))</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\">ggplot(df1, aes(SC, depth)) +</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>geom_point() +</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>facet_wrap(~well, scales=&quot;free&quot;, labeller=label_bquote(.(well)~CV[SI]))+</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>geom_path() +</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>scale_y_reverse() +</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>geom_segment(data=df1, aes(x=-Inf, xend=-Inf, y=tscr, yend=bscr)) +</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>labs(x=&quot;SC (\\u03BCS/cm)&quot;, y=&quot;Depth (bgs)&quot;, title=&quot;SC profiles in well subset; left vertical line denotes screened interval (SI)&quot;, subtitle=expression(paste(&quot;Desired facet label format: &quot;, CV[SI],&quot; = …&quot;)))</font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"monospace, monospace\"><br></font></div>See last answer <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/32671445/expression-in-ggplot2-facet-labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stackoverflow.com/questions/32671445/expression-in-ggplot2-facet-labels&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367040481000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03MGFTAuwVlM24ndL_qeND\">here</a> and ?facet_wrap and ?label_bquote for what it&#39;s doing and why. </div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">HTH, <br>B</div></div></div>\r\n</div></blockquote></div>"
